etween Professional Nutritionists and Chatbots#🟢 Yöntem & Örneklem (Yeşil)":[34,36],"#Comparison of Accuracy in the Evaluation of Nutritional Labels on Commercial Ready-to-Eat Meal Boxes Between Professional Nutritionists and Chatbots#🟢 Yöntem & Örneklem (Yeşil)#{1}":[35,36],"#Comparison of Accuracy in the Evaluation of Nutritional Labels on Commercial Ready-to-Eat Meal Boxes Between Professional Nutritionists and Chatbots#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)":[37,39],"#Comparison of Accuracy in the Evaluation of Nutritional Labels on Commercial Ready-to-Eat Meal Boxes Between Professional Nutritionists and Chatbots#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)#{1}":[38,39],"#Comparison of Accuracy in the Evaluation of Nutritional Labels on Commercial Ready-to-Eat Meal Boxes Between Professional Nutritionists and Chatbots#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)":[40,42],"#Comparison of Accuracy in the Evaluation of Nutritional Labels on Commercial Ready-to-Eat Meal Boxes Between Professional Nutritionists and Chatbots#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)#{1}":[41,42],"#Comparison of Accuracy in the Evaluation of Nutritional Labels on Commercial Ready-to-Eat Meal Boxes Between Professional Nutritionists and Chatbots#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)":[43,44]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Görüntüle","target":"zotero://select/library/items/D8GQ4JV9","line":22},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/CAWQSUPI?page=1&annotation=IBNB2SBN","line":35},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/CAWQSUPI?page=1&annotation=SQBE2SZU","line":35},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/CAWQSUPI?page=1&annotation=9X53KYPN","line":38},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/CAWQSUPI?page=1&annotation=AF9QAQZ2","line":38},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/CAWQSUPI?page=1&annotation=P5DYFFBX","line":41},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/CAWQSUPI?page=1&annotation=Q7NZHPQ2","line":41},{"title":"Sayfa 9","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/CAWQSUPI?page=9&annotation=BHSXZ64P","line":41}],"metadata":{"Title":"Comparison of Accuracy in the Evaluation of Nutritional Labels on Commercial Ready-to-Eat Meal Boxes Between Professional Nutritionists and Chatbots","Authors":"Chin-Feng Hsuan, Yau-Jiunn Lee, Hui-Chun Hsu, Chung-Mei Ouyang, Wen-Chin Yeh, Wei-Hua Tang","Year":2025,"DOI":"10.3390/nu17193044","Nitelik":null,"Alan":null,"Konu":null,"AI_Methodology":null,"Layer_Focus":null,"Model_Asamasi":null,"Proposed_Tool":null,"Methods":"To evaluate the accuracy and clinical applicability of AI-assessed nutrition data by comparing outputs from five AI models with professional dietitian estimations and labeled nutrition factsEight ready-to-eat convenience store meals were analyzed. Four experienced dietitians independently estimated the meals’ calories, macronutrients, and sodium content based on measured food weights. Five AI chatbots were queried multiple times with identical input prompts to assess intraand inter-assay variability. All results were compared to the official nutrition labels to quantify discrepancies and cross-model consistency.","Findings":"Dietitian estimations showed strong internal consistency (CV < 15%), except for fat, saturated fat and sodium (CVs up to 33.3 ± 37.6%, 24.5 ± 11.7%, and 40.2 ± 30.3%, respectively)Sodium values were consistently underestimated across all AI models, with CVs ranging from 20% to 70%. The accuracy of nutritional fact estimation over the five AI models for calories, protein, fat, saturated fat and carbohydrates was between 70 and 90%; when compared to the nutritional labels of RTE, the sodium content and saturated fat estimated were severely underestimated.","Conclusions":"Current AI chat models provide rapid estimates for basic nutrients and can aid public education or preliminary assessment; GPT-4 outperforms peers in calorie and potassium-related estimations but remains suboptimal in micronutrient predictionProfessional dietitian oversight remains essential for safe and personalized dietary planning.Future improvements in AI design, nutrition-specific training, and visual recognition are essential for clinical use. Until then, AI nutritional information should complement, not replace, professional expertise","Limitations":"","User_Notes":"dyt karşılaştırması var  prompt yok"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"pu6fog","at":1774939546063}},"smart_blocks:Augmented Dietitian Okunmuşlar/hsuanComparisonAccuracyEvaluation2025c.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.05074898,-0.02050461,-0.0143143,0.00197136,0.04528589,0.01003234,0.01229363,0.04672993,-0.00161657,-0.01468896,0.00711595,-0.13895546,0.04500396,0.0289179,0.04120881,-0.01808446,0.03118907,-0.01512629,0.00559826,0.01527034,0.08543919,-0.03074401,0.01654942,0.00159645,0.07109354,0.02790025,-0.02495844,-0.02238148,-0.04615076,-0.24038197,0.02792803,-0.02418237,0.08600844,-0.04543346,-0.06507989,0.00353057,0.01141477,0.03207324,-0.02486021,-0.00106045,0.06307965,0.01307551,0.03298088,-0.00880238,0.01603904,-0.02018668,-0.02965061,-0.00072754,-0.03313207,0.01899649,-0.00608346,-0.02850331,0.00884075,0.04662348,0.0319871,0.04533155,0.02122618,0.03086112,0.05262623,0.06313695,-0.00113119,0.08395451,-0.21820405,0.100667,0.03651183,0.03061762,-0.04865785,0.0042229,-0.0132569,-0.0697572,-0.04546432,0.01337161,0.04914213,0.02807557,0.01949434,-0.00615816,0.07317506,-0.01875259,-0.00314061,-0.01860316,-0.00368434,0.08927031,-0.04936795,0.00105018,-0.03512491,-0.05257541,-0.00160678,-0.02635848,0.07654418,-0.05706557,-0.00221332,-0.03072243,-0.00148917,0.02760446,-0.00351608,-0.00429391,-0.00945344,-0.03253053,-0.05881727,0.1016101,-0.02866453,0.00291432,-0.04026246,-0.00384833,0.02890142,-0.0630761,-0.05084963,-0.03814368,-0.04068474,0.0693308,-0.02641986,0.00254304,-0.01321602,-0.03548961,0.00668623,0.07401767,0.1558439,-0.00420969,0.04425409,-0.01159624,-0.0375312,0.03126994,